
@startuml
title Figure 7 - Low-code generation & dynamic discovery (compact 2-column)
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam dpi 150
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #222222
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FAFAFA
skinparam NoteBorderColor #BBBBBB
skinparam ArrowThickness 1.2
skinparam Rectangle {
  RoundCorner 12
}
left to right direction
scale 0.85

rectangle "Developer" as DEV

package "RBciAD Host (Python)" {
  rectangle "Low-Code Creator\n(wizard)" as LCC
  folder "custom_plugins/" as CPL
  rectangle "Registry / Loader" as REG
  rectangle "Palette: [Base] | [Custom]" as PAL
  rectangle "Node Help (auto)" as HELP
}

' --- Flow (2-column compact) ---
DEV --> LCC : name, I/O, params,\nlanguage (Py / Polyglot)
LCC --> CPL : write skeleton(s)
LCC --> HELP : generate help stub
REG --> PAL : refresh (no restart)
CPL --> REG : discovery
HELP --> PAL : attach help

note right of LCC
Python: subclass BaseNode\nPolyglot: input.json / output.json
end note

note right of REG
Shared JSON contract.\nLarge arrays via file paths.
end note
@enduml
